* Sat Sep 26 2026 Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.0.1-1
- Records wificond.rc's stock hash directly instead of naming the .orig copy of
  it, so the tripwire no longer requires the repository to carry that file
  (docs/54). Payload and effect unchanged.
- Requires waydroid-ext-overlay-sync >= 1.1.0 for the hash-only stock column.

* Thu Sep 24 2026 Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.0.0-1
- First package. Ships both files together because each one alone leaves the
  Wi-Fi toggle off, for two entirely different reasons.
- Hard Requires on waydroid-ext-wifid; waydroid-ext-wifid only Recommends this,
  so the pair is not a cycle and the daemon stays testable on an image with no
  overlay at all.
